# The build context for brain/Dockerfile (Docker reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# in place of the root .dockerignore, which keeps only runner/). The image
# copies the start script and the computer's tree-sitter lockfile; nothing
# else from the repository is sent.
*
!brain/start-brain.mjs
!box/deps/package.json
!box/deps/package-lock.json
